      "content": "hey so i need to talk about something weird that keeps happening at work. i dont know if ur like a scientist or something but i've noticed that whenever i get really stressed or even just super angry about something, the lights in my cubicle or my monitor starts flickering like crazy. it happened twice yesterday when my boss was riding me. is it possible like... my nervous system is putting out some kind of energy that's messing with the electronics? it feels way too consistent to be just bad wiring lol",
