      "content": "i tried talking to it but they just said it's \"faulty wiring\" and i feel like they're just dismissing me. it's not just a coincidence though. like when i was really upset about my dog passing away last month, every lamp in the house just... pulsed. it felt like this surge coming from inside me. i'm not saying i'm a superhero or anything but it feels more like an energy thing than a hardware thing. do you think there's any way to actually control it or stabilize it so i don't cause a scene at the office next time i'm frustrated?",
